    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175930/extras/7697d214dc8486bcfd093743f2c8b402.webp?t=1727458543\" width=597 height=38 /></span><br><br>The Painting is a short, emotional visual novel following a grieving man who relives memories of days long gone.<br><br>An exploration of loss presented honestly and kinetically.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175930/extras/293b55962a620f2ea41984113db0c32d.webp?t=1727458543\" width=597 height=38 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175930/extras/ee6346f0b370badbf11a06bcc8823261.webp?t=1727458543\" width=13 height=12 /></span> &lt;1,000 words (10-15 minutes of playtime).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175930/extras/ee6346f0b370badbf11a06bcc8823261.webp?t=1727458543\" width=13 height=12 /></span> A kinetic, hard-hitting story.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175930/extras/ee6346f0b370badbf11a06bcc8823261.webp?t=1727458543\" width=13 height=12 /></span> Hand-drawn visuals.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175930/extras/ee6346f0b370badbf11a06bcc8823261.webp?t=1727458543\" width=13 height=12 /></span> A Steam achievement.<br><br><i>This game was made for the O2A2 VN Jam 2022, a micro Visual Novel jam with strict asset limitations and a 1000 word limit.</i>",
